<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hello, it's me. Put me through to <STYLE ID="1">Akane Kogori-san</STYLE>."<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Ah, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-san</STYLE>, this is Ise. 
{PAUSE ""}
We'll do everything we can, so please, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-san</STYLE>, try to stay strong―
{PAUSE ""}
Yes."<PG>
"Yes, it's a relief to us to hear you say that. We will catch the culprit, I promise you. 
{PAUSE ""}
By the way... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, that's what I'm calling about. 
{PAUSE ""}
A little while ago I went to the home of <STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto-san</STYLE> to check whether <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE> was there. 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, at this point I can't say anything for certain..."<PG>
"But if it's the culprit of the Megasawa City case, they're sure to show up wherever the target is. 
{PAUSE ""}
The second target is unknown, but to be safe, I believe we should secure <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE>'s safety. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, we'll keep a close watch on the <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> residence for a while."<PG>
"That's what I don't really get, the reason <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> would hide <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
So I can't say whether <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE> is really at the <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> residence. 
{PAUSE ""}
We'll check inside the house through the bug, and once her presence is confirmed, we'll wait until the culprit shows up."<PG>
"Huh...?
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE>No, that's not what I meant... 
{PAUSE ""}
But unless we do that, we can't catch that violent criminal. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's all right, we will absolutely guarantee <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE>'s safety. 
{PAUSE ""}
The moment the culprit appears, we'll storm in, protect <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE> and the others, and arrest the culprit."<PG>
"I understand how you feel, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
Please don't say we're using <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE> as bait for the culprit... 
{PAUSE ""}
If anything, it's safer once we can tell the culprit is there. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes... yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
What? But it's still safer for you to stay at the police station, you know?"<PG>
"Like I said, at the police station... 
{PAUSE ""}
No, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, it's true that plan could work, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
I see, <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>'d take <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE>'s place... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll ask once more: you're really going home?
{PAUSE ""}
　I see... If you insist that strongly, we have no right to stop you, but..."<PG>
"No, but <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> should stay at the police station. As a police officer, I can't just stand by and let <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> walk into danger. 
{PAUSE ""}
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
I see. Understood. 
{PAUSE ""}
Then I'll have someone drive you home."<PG>
"Also, I'll post officers around the <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-san</STYLE> residence. 
{PAUSE ""}
Not only the Motoki police but the prefectural police as well will be protecting <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">your daughter</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Just so you know, <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> going home doesn't mean the culprit will necessarily come after <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
For that matter, the Kogori family isn't necessarily the only target. 
{PAUSE ""}
Then, please take care."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Haah, I get how she feels, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
I can't just leave a violent criminal like that on the loose either..."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
